{{define "content"}}
<style>
.schema-table td:first-child { font-family: monospace; white-space: nowrap; }
.example-card { border: 1px solid var(--pico-muted-border-color, #ddd); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.example-card-header { padding: 0.6rem 1rem; background: var(--pico-card-sectionning-background-color, #f6f7fb); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pico-muted-border-color, #ddd); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
.example-card pre { margin: 0; border-radius: 0; }
.code-wrap { position: relative; }
.code-wrap pre { margin: 0; padding-right: 4.5rem; }
.copy-btn { position: absolute; top: 0.45rem; right: 0.5rem; padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem; font-size: 0.72rem; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid var(--pico-muted-border-color,#ccc); border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); color: var(--pico-muted-color,#555); line-height: 1.6; }
.copy-btn:hover { background: var(--pico-primary-background,#e8f0fe); color: var(--pico-primary,#1a73e8); }
.copy-btn.ok { color: #2e7d32; border-color: #2e7d32; }
</style>

<script>
function cp(btn) {
  var text = btn.closest('.code-wrap').querySelector('code').innerText;
  navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function() {
    btn.textContent = '✓'; btn.classList.add('ok');
    setTimeout(function() { btn.textContent = 'Copy'; btn.classList.remove('ok'); }, 2000);
  });
}
</script>

<hgroup>
  <h1>Build Settings</h1>
  <p>저장소 루트에 <code>preview.yml</code>을 추가해 빌드 방식을 설정합니다.</p>
</hgroup>

{{/* ── 형식 ── */}}
<article>
  <header><strong>preview.yml 형식</strong></header>
  <div class="code-wrap">
    <button class="copy-btn" onclick="cp(this)">Copy</button>
    <pre><code># 저장소 루트에 preview.yml 을 추가하세요.

# 빌드 명령어 목록 (순서대로 실행)
build:
  - 명령어1
  - 명령어2

# 컨테이너가 노출하는 포트 (기본: 80)
port: 3000</code></pre>
  </div>

  <p><strong>사용 가능한 환경변수</strong></p>
  <table class="schema-table">
    <thead><tr><th>변수</th><th>값</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>$PREVIEW_ID</td><td>Preview UUID</td></tr>
      <tr><td>$PREVIEW_IMAGE</td><td>Docker 이미지 태그 (e.g. <code>preview-abc123:latest</code>)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>$PREVIEW_SHA</td><td>Git 커밋 SHA</td></tr>
      <tr><td>$PREVIEW_BRANCH</td><td>브랜치 이름</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p><small>
    <code>preview.yml</code>이 없으면 기본값 (<code>docker build -t $PREVIEW_IMAGE .</code>, port 80) 을 사용합니다.<br>
    빌드 명령어는 worktree 디렉토리 안에서 실행됩니다.
  </small></p>
</article>

<h2 style="margin-top:2rem">스택별 예시</h2>

<div class="example-card">
  <div class="example-card-header">🐳 기본 Docker (Dockerfile이 있는 경우)</div>
  <div class="code-wrap">
    <button class="copy-btn" onclick="cp(this)">Copy</button>
    <pre><code>build:
  - docker build -t $PREVIEW_IMAGE .
port: 80</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="example-card">
  <div class="example-card-header">⚛️ Next.js / React (Node.js)</div>
  <div class="code-wrap">
    <button class="copy-btn" onclick="cp(this)">Copy</button>
    <pre><code>build:
  - docker build -t $PREVIEW_IMAGE .
port: 3000</code></pre>
  </div>
  <div style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--pico-muted-color,#666)">
    Dockerfile 예시:
  </div>
  <div class="code-wrap">
    <button class="copy-btn" onclick="cp(this)">Copy</button>
    <pre><code>FROM node:20-alpine
WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm ci
COPY . .
RUN npm run build
EXPOSE 3000
CMD ["npm", "start"]</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="example-card">
  <div class="example-card-header">🐍 Python (FastAPI / Flask)</div>
  <div class="code-wrap">
    <button class="copy-btn" onclick="cp(this)">Copy</button>
    <pre><code>build:
  - docker build -t $PREVIEW_IMAGE .
port: 8000</code></pre>
  </div>
  <div style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--pico-muted-color,#666)">
    Dockerfile 예시:
  </div>
  <div class="code-wrap">
    <button class="copy-btn" onclick="cp(this)">Copy</button>
    <pre><code>FROM python:3.12-slim
WORKDIR /app
COPY requirements.txt .
RUN pip install -r requirements.txt
COPY . .
EXPOSE 8000
CMD ["uvicorn", "main:app", "--host", "0.0.0.0", "--port", "8000"]</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="example-card">
  <div class="example-card-header">🐹 Go</div>
  <div class="code-wrap">
    <button class="copy-btn" onclick="cp(this)">Copy</button>
    <pre><code>build:
  - docker build -t $PREVIEW_IMAGE .
port: 8080</code></pre>
  </div>
  <div style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--pico-muted-color,#666)">
    Dockerfile 예시:
  </div>
  <div class="code-wrap">
    <button class="copy-btn" onclick="cp(this)">Copy</button>
    <pre><code>FROM golang:1.22-alpine AS builder
WORKDIR /app
COPY . .
RUN go build -o server .

FROM alpine:3.20
COPY --from=builder /app/server /server
EXPOSE 8080
CMD ["/server"]</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="example-card">
  <div class="example-card-header">🛠 멀티 스텝 빌드 (빌드 전처리 포함)</div>
  <div class="code-wrap">
    <button class="copy-btn" onclick="cp(this)">Copy</button>
    <pre><code>build:
  - echo "Building branch $PREVIEW_BRANCH (SHA: $PREVIEW_SHA)"
  - docker build --build-arg SHA=$PREVIEW_SHA -t $PREVIEW_IMAGE .
port: 3000</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>

{{end}}
